<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>StepFun 推出面向智能体工作的 Step 5 Preview</title><link>https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-5-Preview</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-5-Preview</guid><description>条目将 Step 5 Preview 定位为 StepFun 面向智能体工作的旗舰模型；给定材料未提供性能、价格或部署条件。</description><source url="https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-5-Preview">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>JetBrains 计划在 2026.3 版本中随 IDE 提供 Air</title><link>https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/10/air-in-ides-eap/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/10/air-in-ides-eap/</guid><description>条目称，计划于 11 月发布的 JetBrains IDE 2026.3 将包含 Air，链接指向相关早期访问介绍。</description><source url="https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/10/air-in-ides-eap/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>SentinelOne 案例称恶意软件分析由数周缩短至数小时</title><link>https://openai.com/index/sentinelone</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/sentinelone</guid><description>OpenAI 发布的案例称，SentinelOne 使用 OpenAI Daybreak 将恶意软件分析从数周缩短到数小时，从而增加可调查威胁的数量。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/sentinelone">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>vLLM v0.32.0rc1 涉及 Humming 依赖与 NVFP4 处理变更</title><link>https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.32.0rc1</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.32.0rc1</guid><description>该候选版本的发布标题提到更新 Humming，并移除 NVFP4 scale 的一项临时处理；给定材料未说明完整影响范围。</description><source url="https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.32.0rc1">GitHub Release: vllm-project/vllm</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Claude Code v2.1.300 增加提示区展示与缓存遥测字段</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.300</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.300</guid><description>发布摘要列出 virtualText：可在提示输入框显示、但不会进入草稿或提交提示的文字；同时列出与 OpenTelemetry 相关的 cache_creation_5m_tokens 和 cache_creation_1h_tokens 字段。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.300">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>LangGraph PostgreSQL checkpoint 组件发布 3.2.0</title><link>https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/releases/tag/checkpointpostgres%3D%3D3.2.0</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/releases/tag/checkpointpostgres%3D%3D3.2.0</guid><description>langgraph-checkpoint-postgres 发布 3.2.0，摘要标明相对 3.1.3 的变更入口，但未给出具体修复或兼容性细节。</description><source url="https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/releases/tag/checkpointpostgres%3D%3D3.2.0">GitHub Release: langchain-ai/langgraph</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>优先补齐 LLM 搜索结果的信任边界知识</title><link>https://www.unite.ai/five-possible-back-doors-into-llm-search-results/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.unite.ai/five-possible-back-doors-into-llm-search-results/</guid><description>文章主题是进入 LLM 搜索结果的五种可能后门；给定摘要没有列出具体机制。</description><source url="https://www.unite.ai/five-possible-back-doors-into-llm-search-results/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习本地 AI 基准测试，建立自己的硬件选型依据</title><link>https://www.meauxsoft.com/News/AI_Benchmark.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.meauxsoft.com/News/AI_Benchmark.html</guid><description>条目提供针对 Minisforum MS-S1 的本地 AI 基准测试，给定材料未包含模型配置、测试方法或成绩。</description><source url="https://www.meauxsoft.com/News/AI_Benchmark.html">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Amp 案例将智能体应用范围延伸至编程之外</title><link>https://openai.com/index/amp-beyond-coding</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/amp-beyond-coding</guid><description>OpenAI 的案例介绍 Amp 使用其模型探索编程之外的智能体任务；给定摘要未披露具体业务成效或招聘需求。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/amp-beyond-coding">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Linux 内核开发者取消强制披露 AI 工具使用的要求</title><link>https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/10/14/linux-kernel-devs-drop-obligatory-confession-of-ai-tool-usage/5303140</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/10/14/linux-kernel-devs-drop-obligatory-confession-of-ai-tool-usage/5303140</guid><description>据条目标题，Linux 内核开发者取消了强制披露 AI 工具使用的要求；具体政策范围和其他贡献要求需查阅原文。</description><source url="https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/10/14/linux-kernel-devs-drop-obligatory-confession-of-ai-tool-usage/5303140">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item></channel></rss>
